sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GMUI as ContentManagerUI
  participant API as CompendiumRouter
  participant APP as CompendiumApplicationService
  participant VAL as DefinitionContractPolicy
  participant LRES as LinkedEntryResolutionService
  participant DEF as DefinitionRepository
  participant LREP as LinkedEntryRepository
  participant REV as CatalogRevisionRepository
  participant IDX as SearchIndexRepository
  participant EVT as ContentEventsMapper
  participant WS as ContentStream

  Note over GMUI,WS: Precondition: pack core_srd5e in draft state, catalog_revision=301

  GMUI->>API: POST /api/spells req-5001 (draft spell.arcane_aegis + linked refs)
  API->>APP: create_definition(req-5001)
  APP->>VAL: validate_required_fields(spell payload)
  VAL-->>APP: ok
  APP->>LRES: validate_references(spell.arcane_aegis refs)
  LRES-->>APP: ok (targets exist, no cycle)

  APP->>DEF: create(spell.arcane_aegis@v1 draft)
  DEF-->>APP: persisted definition_id=spell.arcane_aegis
  APP->>LREP: upsert_links(spell.arcane_aegis -> feat.warcaster, condition.shielded)
  LREP-->>APP: links persisted
  APP->>REV: create_revision(reason=mutation, req-5001)
  REV-->>APP: catalog_revision=302
  APP->>IDX: upsert_document(spell.arcane_aegis@rev302)
  IDX-->>APP: indexed
  APP->>EVT: to_definition_created_event(req-5001, rev302)
  EVT-->>WS: definition_created(event)
  APP-->>API: resolved status + definition_id + rev302
  API-->>GMUI: 201 Created (state=draft, content_version=1, catalog_revision=302)

  GMUI->>API: POST /api/spells/spell.arcane_aegis/publish req-5002
  API->>APP: publish_definition(req-5002)
  APP->>VAL: validate_publish_contract(spell.arcane_aegis)
  VAL-->>APP: ok
  APP->>LRES: resolve_forward_links(spell.arcane_aegis)
  LRES-->>APP: all required targets resolvable
  APP->>DEF: update lifecycle_state draft->published
  DEF-->>APP: lifecycle persisted
  APP->>REV: create_revision(reason=publish, req-5002)
  REV-->>APP: catalog_revision=303
  APP->>IDX: upsert_document(spell.arcane_aegis visible=published rev303)
  IDX-->>APP: index updated
  APP->>EVT: to_definition_published_event(req-5002, rev303)
  EVT-->>WS: definition_published(event)
  APP-->>API: resolved status + rev303
  API-->>GMUI: 200 OK (state=published, catalog_revision=303)

  Note over GMUI,WS: Postcondition: spell.arcane_aegis is published and query-visible at revision 303